@startuml Add_Student_To_Group
title Activity Diagram - Add Student to Group

|Instructor|
start
:Select a group;
:Click "Add Member";
:Enter student ID or email;
:Select role (optional);
:Click "Add";

|Web Application|
:Validate input data;
if (Valid?) then (no)
  :Display validation error;
  stop
endif

:Send request to add member\nto group;

|Backend API|
:Validate request body;
:Call GroupManagementService.\nAddMemberAsync(groupId, request);
:Check if group exists;
if (Group not found?) then (yes)
  :Return 404 Not Found;
  stop
endif

:Check if student exists;
if (Student not found?) then (yes)
  :Return 404 Not Found;
  stop
endif

:Check if student already\nin another group in same class;
if (Already in group?) then (yes)
  :Return 400 Bad Request\n"Student already in group";
  stop
endif

:Create GroupMember entity;
:Save to database;
:Send notification to student;
:Return GroupMemberOperationResponseDto;
:Send 200 OK response;

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display success message;
  :Refresh group members list;
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Instructor|
:View updated group members;
stop
@enduml

